values ('ap_precalculus', 3, '3.5', array['3.5', '3.7']::text[], 'formula', 'Period and frequency are reciprocals', '\text{frequency}=\frac{1}{\text{period}},\qquad \text{period}=\frac{1}{\text{frequency}};\quad \text{for } \sin\theta \text{ and } \cos\theta:\ \text{period}=2\pi,\ \text{frequency}=\frac{1}{2\pi}', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-precalculus-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_precalculus-u3-r3-002; ced=3.5.A.2: "The period and frequency of a sinusoidal function are reciprocals."; product-owner-directed correction by the Claude session (David, 2026-10-10): the escalated row was corrected against its own CED evidence and re-checked by both independent checkers and the own-family veto')
