values ('ap_precalculus', 3, '3.8', array['3.8']::text[], 'convention', 'Reflections in tangent transformations', 'For g(θ) = a tan θ, a < 0 reflects the graph over the x-axis; for g(θ) = tan(bθ), b < 0 reflects the graph over the y-axis.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-precalculus-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_precalculus-u3-r1-026; ced=3.8.C.3 "If a < 0, the transformation involves a reflection over the x-axis"; 3.8.C.4')
