values ('ap_precalculus', 3, '3.9', array['3.9', '3.10', '3.12']::text[], 'vocabulary', 'Inverse trigonometric functions (arcsine, arccosine, arctangent)', 'Inverse trigonometric functions, written arcsin x, arccos x, arctan x or sin⁻¹x, cos⁻¹x, tan⁻¹x, switch the inputs and outputs of the trig functions, so the input is a trig value and the output is often interpreted as an angle measure.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-precalculus-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_precalculus-u3-r1-028; ced=3.9.A.1-3.9.A.2 "called arcsine, arccosine, and arctangent"')
