values ('ap_precalculus', 3, '3.11', array['3.11', '3.12']::text[], 'formula', 'Secant, cosecant, and cotangent definitions', '\sec\theta=\frac{1}{\cos\theta}\ (\cos\theta\neq0),\qquad \csc\theta=\frac{1}{\sin\theta}\ (\sin\theta\neq0),\qquad \cot\theta=\frac{1}{\tan\theta}\ (\tan\theta\neq0)=\frac{\cos\theta}{\sin\theta}\ (\sin\theta\neq0)', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-precalculus-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_precalculus-u3-r3-004; ced=3.11.A.1–3.11.A.4: "the reciprocal of the cosine function"; "the reciprocal of the sine function"; "cot θ = cos θ / sin θ"; product-owner-directed correction by the Claude session (David, 2026-10-10): the escalated row was corrected against its own CED evidence and re-checked by both independent checkers and the own-family veto')
