values ('ap_precalculus', 3, '3.12', array['3.12']::text[], 'convention', 'Difference and double-angle identities come from the sum identities', 'The sine and cosine sum identities can also be used as difference and double-angle identities, and known identities plus algebraic properties can verify additional identities.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-precalculus-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_precalculus-u3-r1-035; ced=3.12.B.3 "can also be used as difference and double-angle identities"')
