values ('ap_precalculus', 3, '3.15', array['3.15']::text[], 'list_sequence', 'Distance from the origin for r = f(θ)', 'How the sign and direction of change of f(θ) determine whether the point''s distance from the origin increases or decreases.', '[{"label": "Positive and increasing", "meaning": "distance from the origin is increasing"}, {"label": "Negative and decreasing", "meaning": "distance from the origin is increasing"}, {"label": "Positive and decreasing", "meaning": "distance from the origin is decreasing"}, {"label": "Negative and increasing", "meaning": "distance from the origin is decreasing"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Describe the signed radius as increasing or decreasing and the distance as increasing or decreasing. Do not equate the two when r is negative.', 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-precalculus-reference-u1-u3-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_precalculus-u3-r1-041; ced=3.15.A.1, 3.15.A.2')
